        <mxCell id="c91" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Use case coverage: arrows used by each use case (details in ADR.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC1  View deposits and rates on the website:&lt;/b&gt; 1, 2, 3, 13, 17, 21&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC2  Submit an application on the website:&lt;/b&gt; 1, 2, 3, 14, 18, 25&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC3  Call center processes the website application, special rate:&lt;/b&gt; 32, 33, 30, 28, 27, 26, 24, 22, 23, 34, 35&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC4  Open the deposit in a branch for a new client:&lt;/b&gt; 29, 28, 27, 26, 24, 22, 23, 34, 35&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC5  Personalized rates in the IB:&lt;/b&gt; 4, 9, 6, 5, 7, 8, 13, 17, 21&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC6  Submit an IB application, confirm with SMS code:&lt;/b&gt; 5, 7, 8, 14, 18, 15, 19, 16, 34, 35, 22&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC7  Back office confirms the rate:&lt;/b&gt; 24, 26, 27, 30, 28, 22, 23, 34, 35&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC8  Deposit opened, client notified:&lt;/b&gt; 30, 28, 27, 26, 24, 22, 23, 34, 35&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC9  Maintain and publish rates:&lt;/b&gt; 31, 30, 28, 27, 26, 24, 21, 17&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UC10 Application status in the IB:&lt;/b&gt; 5, 7, 14, 18, 22" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1640" width="1640" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
